<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friday's spot rupee rates in the kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.10		 41.15</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	65.35		 65.45</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 24.25		 24.30</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.333		 0.335</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   10.96		 10.98</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.19		 11.21</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.07		  1.09</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 2.45 pct	    2.65 pct</p>
</text>
